<h1 class="h3 mb-3">Manufacturing</h1>
<p class="text-muted">
    Allocate serials ahead of time for the casings, then rekey each one when its board is flashed
    (that issues its registration code) and confirm it with the code read back from the unit. A unit
    can only be registered by a participant once it is <strong>Manufactured</strong>. Track the rest
    of its production on its checklist, with the parts and assemblies it is made of from the catalog.
</p>

<partial name="_DashboardCards" model="cards" />

<h2 class="h5 text-muted mt-5 mb-3">Less often</h2>
<partial name="_DashboardCards" model="moreCards" />
